Spoilers...

Just Apply the unicorn horn.  It does some really nice things for you,
like cure blindness and hallucination, among other things.
It does not matter what alignment type unicorn the horn comes from;
a horn is just a horn.

As for killing unicorns, it is not always minus luck to kill a one.
Just don't kill a unicorn of your own alignment.  
